BUILD 2026-11-06a · Power BI Desktop May 2026 (.pbix) · follows `P6A_LAYOUT_AND_CONTRACT.md` v1.2 + Part I (positions,
colours, rules) and `P6A_MEASURES_TE2.csx` BUILD 06e (108 measures). About 3 hours. Work on a **copy** of the .pbix.

How to read this guide (same as P1 / P5-W)
- Every visual gets: **where** (X · Y · W · H, typed in Format ▸ General ▸ Properties ▸ Size and position, never
  dragged), **what** (fields), **how** (only what the theme does not already set), **name** (Selection pane).
- **Checkpoint** = stop, look at that part of the page, flag anything that looks off before going on.
- A setting not where written: use the search box at the top of the Format pane.
- Reference figures are for **as-of 4 Nov 2026** (nothing picked in As of), scope Hedge fund, **Facts** unless stated,
  Compare 1W, NAV report Aug 2026. On CORTEX the 16A figures move a little (≈ €440m / €7.01bn).
- Colours: page `#0E141D` · canvas `#141C27` · card `#1D2735` · border `#2C3A4D` · teal `#46B6C9` · coral `#E8597A` ·
  amber `#E0A44B` · green `#56C08D` · slate `#8A97AB` · violet `#9B8BD6` · text `#E8EEF5` · muted `#8C9BB0`.

